WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:04.203
Well, we know that he is
a great comforter,
the president... (CHUCKLES)

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:07.507
...because we saw him
with a group of victims
of gun violence this week,

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:11.978
we saw in Puerto Rico before,
when he talked to
the war widow on the phone,

00:00:12.044 --> 00:00:15.481
comforting is not his thing.
He had to have a crib sheet.

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:18.283
<i>Look at that, it's in his hand.
 They actually wrote--</i>

00:00:18.484 --> 00:00:20.887
<i> Look at the last one:
 "I hear you."</i>

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:22.221
(SCATTERED LAUGHTER)

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:24.423
<i> They had to write
 on the bottom of it,
 "I hear you,"</i>

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:26.359
<i> for him to be reminded
 to say that.</i>

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:28.327
We found out that
in the Trump administration,

00:00:28.427 --> 00:00:30.663
everybody has these crib sheets,
you know, like notes to self.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:31.698
(SCATTERED LAUGHTER)

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:34.200
So it's a new department here,
it's called "Notes to Self."

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:35.200
(ERIC LAUGHS)

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:37.670
-We're gonna show you
what everybody in the...
-(APPLAUSE)

00:00:37.736 --> 00:00:40.272
...Trump White House, er...

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:43.843
For example, Donald Trump Jr.:
"Food goes in mouth."

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:47.012
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:50.850
Jeff Sessions:
"It's 'African-American,'
not 'colored'."

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:52.385
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:00:52.518 --> 00:00:55.154
These are things
they have to remind themselves.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:58.291
Sarah Huckabee Sanders has
"Wife beaters = bad."

00:00:58.491 --> 00:00:59.793
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)
-"Oh, I see."

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:02.628
(ERIC LAUGHS)

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:06.666
Rick Perry,
our energy secretary:
"Don't call it ''lectricity'"

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:09.102
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:01:11.103 --> 00:01:14.007
Melania: "It's so big,
you're hurting me."

00:01:14.173 --> 00:01:16.609
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)
-Yes...

00:01:18.511 --> 00:01:20.546
AUDIENCE MEMBER: Oh!

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:25.385 line:0%
Ivanka's says, "Refer to Jared
as 'husband'
not 'co-conspirator'."

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:28.421 line:0%
(APPLAUSE)

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:31.457 line:0%
Jared: "Find out what
'two-state solution' means."

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:34.494
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:38.330
Sean Hannity:
"Don't get any in your hair."

00:01:38.464 --> 00:01:40.533
AUDIENCE: Oh!

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:42.735
(CHUCKLES)

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:45.571
Ted Cruz: "Watch what humans do,
act like them."

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:47.439
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:01:47.506 --> 00:01:50.477
(APPLAUSE)

00:01:51.077 --> 00:01:54.714
And John Kelly:
"Unplug nuclear button." Please!

